{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手楊千嬅與衛蘭今晚（27日）到文化中心，為將於下月12日在澳門舉行的慈善演唱會綵排，屆時還有歌手江海迦和岑寧兒一同參與，跟50位管弦樂團年輕樂手進行演出，而4位女歌手亦會互唱對方的歌，千嬅説：「好多謝佢哋唱我嘅《火鳥》。</p><p>」衛蘭大讚3位歌手</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T13:03:54.972741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T12:20:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:14.817046+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T12:57:14.817046+00:00","content_hash":"a5b8b30b4b55171b415a24fe545ba41838703b55beecde052c26a9c7441fec21","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}